This distribution extracts the KK OpenList adaptation's translucent panels,
rounded controls, dark/light variables, responsive styles and wallpaper
controller. The wallpaper controller has been made configurable and hardened
for empty lists, failed requests, restricted storage and client-side routes.

Site-specific announcements, contact details, branding assets, wallpaper
catalogue, signed URLs, OpenList server code, databases and configuration
files are not part of this distribution. No wallpaper image license is granted.
